# {{product}} — code navigation by knowledge graph

Answer questions about this codebase by querying its **knowledge graph** through the
`{{server_name}}` MCP tools; prefer the graph over reading files. The graph holds files,
functions, types, and their edges.

If the tools are missing, the `{{server_name}}` MCP server is not connected — check
`{{registration_path}}` and that `{{bridge_bin}}` is on disk.

