## Keeping the graph fresh

The graph is served by a background daemon over `{{socket_path}}`. It updates itself
while `{{cli_bin}} project watch on` is running, and the installed git hooks refresh it
at each commit. To force a synchronous update: `{{cli_bin}} project index`.
